00","session_id":"session_27","session_index":27,"source_sha256":"5184ecf09baaa30815775be896127748b89749fe17ee9c2af2496ad353ab0edc","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":13}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-29, caught up with Calvin (\"Hey Dave!\"): Calvin told him that since they last talked he went to a networking event to meet more artists — \"So cool!\" — and that the people he met will help him build up his fan base — \"Super excited about what it could lead to\" (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md) [S27T1]. Dave then told Calvin he's been getting into photography recently — he's \"seen some amazing places and taken some great shots\" — and offered to show Calvin them (details in the Photography section of this file) [S27T2]; Calvin: \"Yeah, show me what you got!\" [S27T3]. Dave shared two Boston photos: first, a photo of a city skyline at sunset with a clock tower — \"Look at this magnificent sunset I captured on camera. It's truly breathtaking to witness such beautiful sunsets! The sky looks like it's on fire!\" (Calvin: \"Wow, that view looks awesome! What city is it?\") [S27T4][S27T5]; second, a photo of the clock tower in the city with buildings around it, which he took last month (~September 2023) at sunset — \"got a great shot - it was stunning!\" (Calvin: \"Wow, that pic is amazing!\") [S27T6]. Calvin recognized the clock tower (\"In your last photo, is that the clock tower?\") and said he was in Boston a few years back and it's \"such a beautiful city. You're so talented, Dave!\" (Calvin's side in the Boston trip section of /memories/calvin.md) [S27T5][S27T7]. Dave confirmed it is the clock tower — he snapped it at sunset and the colors were stunning — and said photography helps him capture and appreciate the beauty of nature — \"It's been an awesome creative outlet and I'm loving it.\" (details in the Photography section of this file); Dave: \"Thanks, Calvin! Your kind words mean a lot.\" [S27T7][S27T8]. The conversation continued: Calvin asked how Dave's car project was going, and Dave said he had \"just finished restoring it and it looks amazing,\" inviting Calvin over to check it out (details in ## Classic cars), and then asked how everything was with the music (\"Any updates?\"); Calvin: he'd had some great collaborations recently and his album is almost finished, and he'll send Dave some previews soon (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md); the chat closed with the two arranging a catch-up when one of them is free — Calvin: \"Let me know when you're free for a catch-up.\" Dave: \"Cool, Calvin! Can't wait to hear it. Let me know when you're free and take it easy!\" Calvin: \"Cheers! I'll let you know when I'm free. Bye!\" [S27T9][S27T10][S27T11][S27T12][S27T13].","text_sha256":"06b00a55c3a470022c7e6f1300da3a244bdf994f37d6bedbac8e199acb84fcef","timestamp":"2023-10-29T10:49:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D27:1","D27:2","D27:3","D27:4","D27:5","D27:6","D27:7","D27:8","D27:9","D27:10","D27:11","D27:12","D27:13"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":244,"line_start":244,"source_locators":["[S27T1]","[S27T2]","[S27T3]","[S27T4]","[S27T5]","[S27T6]","[S27T7]","[S27T8]","[S27T9]","[S27T10]","[S27T11]","[S27T12]","[S27T13]"],"text_sha256":"bc1b49b45350bbcbb1d35f9567d81c89e39350e43c740c9b1ce21c9f8b12f21e"}],"dia_ids":["D27:1","D27:2","D27:3","D27:4","D27:5","D27:6","D27:7","D27:8","D27:9","D27:10","D27:11","D27:12","D27:13"],"evidence_id":"ev-4f94f396d04b3a5c71bba558c40fca7fd064137d4e1e498020972a20c742f469","group_id":"/memories/calvin.md > # Calvin","line_end":244,"line_start":244,"observation_ids":["obs-0002"],"path":"/memories/calvin.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":4,"sc